    "text": "knco.com\nwebsite\nGrass Valley\nGV Council Balks For Now At New Parking Pgm\nBy Chris Gilbert,\n6 hours agoAt their Tuesday night meeting, there was no decision yet from the Grass Valley City Council on how to implement a Residential Permit Parking program. Much of the discussion centered around the cost of a permit. Police Chief Alex Gammelgard said many residents on Mill Street who live near the business improvement district, including the Plaza, have no garage or driveway to park their vehicles at their home. And street parking availability has been getting tighter…",
